        "comment" : "Flags up to 100 records where a service label doesn't match the country code to pinpoint mapping errors that can distort reporting and analytics; correcting these mismatches improves data accuracy, reduces compliance and billing risks, and ensures services are attributed to the right country for pricing and planning.",
